  "prefLabel": "Man 402.05 Certification by Respondent",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-07-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Man 402.05 Certification by Respondent. By signing, the respondent shall certify under the penalties of RSA 641:3 that:\n\n(a) All of the facts contained in this rebuttal are complete and truthful to the best of the signer's knowledge; and\n\n(b) A completed copy of Section II - Respondent has been mailed or delivered to the complainant on the same day.\n\nSource. #6162, eff 1-4-96, EXPIRED: 1-4-04\n\nNew. #8029, INTERIM, eff 1-17-04, EXPIRED: 7-15-04\n\nNew. #8287, eff 2-16-05; ss by #10313, eff 4-13-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/man100-400.html"
